* Placa MV - saida: PC817 (CTR 50/100/200%) x NPN BC337 direto. GPIO=3.3V ligado
.model QN NPN(IS=6.7e-15 BF=200 VAF=74 IKF=0.5 RB=10 RC=0.3)
.model DLED D(IS=1e-18 N=1.9 RS=3)
.param VS=12 RPU=1000 CTR=0.5
VSIG vs 0 {VS}
RPU vs s1 {RPU}
RPU2 vs s2 {RPU}
VG g 0 3.3
* --- PC817: LED + fototransistor (fonte de corrente limitada pelo CTR, saturacao via diodo) ---
R330 g a 330
DL a k DLED
VSENS k 0 0
GPH s1 e1 value={ min(CTR*i(VSENS), (v(s1)-v(e1))/0.15 ) }
VE e1 0 0
* --- NPN direto ---
RB g b 1k
Q2 s2 b 0 QN
.control
foreach vs 5 12 24
  foreach rpu 1000 4700
    foreach ctr 0.5 1 2
      alterparam VS=$vs
      alterparam RPU=$rpu
      alterparam CTR=$ctr
      reset
      op
      echo "VS=$vs RPU=$rpu CTR=$ctr  I_LED=$&i(VSENS)  sinal_PC817=$&v(s1)  sinal_NPN=$&v(s2)"
    end
  end
end
.endc
.end
